    {
      "id": "note-overview",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": -680,
        "y": 60
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "A complete DDPM in four nodes. SyntheticShapes makes 256 images of soft blobs. DiffusionTrainingLoop adds noise at a random timestep and trains the U-Net to predict that noise. DDPMSampler then starts from pure Gaussian noise and removes the predicted noise one step at a time, producing new blob images the model was never shown.\n\n四個節點組成完整的 DDPM。SyntheticShapes 產生 256 張柔和光斑的影像。DiffusionTrainingLoop 在隨機的時間步加入雜訊，訓練 U-Net 預測加進去的雜訊。DDPMSampler 接著從純高斯雜訊出發，一步一步扣掉預測的雜訊，生成模型沒看過的新光斑影像。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "start",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": -420,
          "y": 0
        },
        "noteWidth": 360
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "note-sampler",
      "type": "note",
      "position": {
        "x": 720,
        "y": 570
      },
      "data": {
        "noteKind": "text",
        "noteContent": "The sampler's schedule (linear, 160 steps, beta 0.0001 to 0.05) matches the training loop's. A sampler run with a different schedule removes the wrong amount of noise per step.\n\n取樣器的排程（linear、160 步、beta 0.0001 到 0.05）和訓練迴圈一致。若取樣器用不同的排程，每一步扣掉的雜訊量就會不對。",
        "noteColor": "#3d3d1a",
        "boundToNodeId": "sample",
        "boundOffset": {
          "x": 0,
          "y": 370
        },
        "noteWidth": 300
      }
    }
  ],
